+// Shrinks and repositions the SUB engine's composited overlay content (see
+// sim_config's SIM_CONFIG_SCREEN_LAYOUT_MAIN_ONLY) within the window. scale
+// 1.0 (the default) draws it full-size as normal; e.g. 0.5 draws it at half
+// size, with the MAIN engine's base content showing through around it.
+// anchorX/anchorY (0..1, default 0.5/0.5 = centered) place the center of
